  "_comment": "JSON has no comments; see sftp_config.yaml.example for the fully-documented template, including how to generate an SSH key (ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C you@example.com) and install its .pub on the server. sftp_key should point at your PUBLIC key so no private-key material lives here.",
